  _description: A bow that is built from dragon scales and tethlite, a common mineral
    known for its gold-like color.  This is one of the best bows in existance for
    bow masters that can handle the intense draw weight.  A great weapon for hunting
    giant creatures.  This weapon inflicts thunder damage.
